        "created_at": "2019-04-01T19:17:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Handelabra sent out a survey today and this is about the&nbsp;question \"If there is something not listed above that you would like to see in Sentinels of the Multiverse, tell us about it here.\"</p>\n<p>My suggestion was a statistics age per hero/villain/environment wich records things like highest damage dealt in one turn, total games played, total games won, etc.</p>\n<p>Do you like this suggestion? Or what other new feature (not listed)&nbsp;would you like to see in the game?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
